# Raw hero sequence: 300 PNGs at 720x1280, ~210 MB, shipped as a zip. Kept out
# of the repository entirely — git stores it uncompressed forever, and it is a
# source asset the build does not need.
#
# public/hero/ holds the encoded WebP tiers (~3 MB) and IS committed, so a clone
# builds without the source frames. To re-encode:
#   node scripts/encode-hero.mjs --src <dir-of-pngs> --out public/hero --last 266
#
# The turn completes at frame 266; 267-300 drift past eye contact and are cut.
*.psd
*.zip
/raw-hero/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
